   "notes": "Recipe is fully defined in the paper Methods (same M9 base as M9M but with glucose as the limiting carbon source instead of maltose). Base salts expanded from the cited Difco M9 Minimal Salts 5x (248510) formula. The current_components list carried model-default trace metals (Co2+, Cu2+, Fe2+, Fe3+, Mn2+, Zn2+) that are NOT present in Difco M9 salts nor in any supplement stated by the paper; these were dropped as unsupported. No trace-element solution, no additional vitamins, and no anaerobic reductant/gas are part of this medium."
